$DATUM 3,3'-didodecyl-2,2'-bithiophene 8.2 Known compound 8 was prepared and
isolated via the published procedure (Kumada coupling of dodecyl
magnesium bromide and 3,3'-dibromo-2,2'-bithiophene) as a colorless solid
(92 %) after column chromatography. 3,3'-didodecyl-2,2'-bithiophene 8,
yield (92 %) 1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz, ppm): δ 7.26 (d, 2H), 6.94 (d, 2H),
2.47 (t, 4H), 1.51 (m, 4H), 1.23 (m, 36H), 0.87 (t, 6H). 13C NMR (CDCl3,
100 MHz, ppm): δ 142.56, 128.93, 128.74, 125.43, 32.15, 30.94, 29.91,
29.89, 29.79, 29.67, 29.65, 29.59, 29.00, 22.92, 14.35 (Note: two peaks
in 13C NMR spectrum overlap). mp: 52 °C. GC-MS: m/z: 502 (C32H54S2+), 502
(100%).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Kumada coupling, no experimental detail
