$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 4,4,5,5-Tetramethyl-2-(5-(naphthalen-1-yl)thiophen-2-yl)-1,3,2-dioxaborolane
(2j) A solution of 1b (373 mg, 1.00 mmol), 1-bromonaphthalene (5j; 207
mg, 1.00 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (2.3 mg, 1 mol%) and SPhos (8.2 mg, 2 mol%) in
toluene (8 mL) was heated to 65 °C for 40 h. The reaction mixture was
cooled to 20 °C, filtered through a short plug of silica (5 x 2 cm;
eluent: ethyl acetate) and the volatiles were removed in vacuo. The black
solid was purified by sublimation (90 °C, 2 x 10-2 mbar). White solid.
Yield 307 mg, 91 %. 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 8.25 - 8.22 (m, 1 H,
Naph-H), 7.92 - 7.86 (m, 2 H, Naph-H), 7.73 (d, 3J = 3.5 Hz, 1 H, Tph-H),
7.59 (dd, 3J = 7.1 Hz, 4J = 1.1 Hz, 1 H, Naph-H), 7.54 - 7.47 (m, 3 H,
Naph-H), 7.34 (d, 3J = 3.5 Hz, 1 H, Tph-H), 1.40 (s, 12 H, pin-CH3) ppm.
13C NMR (126 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 149.2 (Tph-C), 137.6 (Tph-CH), 134.0
(Naph-C), 132.6 (Naph-C), 131.8 (Naph- C), 129.1 (Tph-CH or Naph-CH),
128.7 (Tph-CH or Naph-CH), 128.4 (Tph-CH or Naph-CH), 128.2 (Tph-CH or
Naph-CH), 126.6 (Naph-CH), 126.2 (Naph-CH), 125.9 (Naph-CH), 125.4
(Naph-CH), 84.3 (pin-C(CH3)2), 24.9 (pin- CH3) ppm.3 11B NMR (160 MHz,
CDCl3): δ = 29.0 ppm. M.p.: 138 °C. IR (ATR): ν̃ = 2977 (w), 2926 (w),
1531 (m), 1475 (m), 1389 (m), 1371 (m), 1349 (s), 1331 (s), 1294 (m),
1262 (m), 1140 (s), 1063 (m), 1049 (m), 854 (m), 822 (m), 798 (s), 774
(s), 662 (s), 606 (m) cm-1. MS (EI, 70 eV): m/z (%) = 336 (100) [M]+. MS
(CI, isobutane): m/z (%) = 337 (100) [M + H]+. HRMS (ESI): Found
359.1254; calcd. for C2021BNaO2S 359.1248. EA (%): Found C (70.13), H
(6.30), S (9.39); calcd. for C20H21BO2S C (71.44), H (6.29), S (9.54).
