$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Entry 1 A mixture of POPd (16.0 mg, 6 mol %), ary lhalide derivative (0.6
mmol), phenyltrimethylstannane (0.7 mmol), and Cy2NMe (120 mg, 0.61 mmol)
was stirred in 5 mL of deionized water at 140 °C using a closed vessel.
After 24 h, the reaction mixture was allowed to cool to room temperature
and extracted with Et2O. The combined organic layers were washed with
brine and dried over MgSO4, and the solvents were removed under vacuum.
Yield (%) 91.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM green chemistry (recyclable catalyst), green chemistry-solvent, Still
cross-coupling, optimized on catalyst
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
