$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 3,3'-didodecyl-2,2'-bithiophene 8.2 Known
compound 8 was prepared and isolated via the published procedure (Kumada
coupling of dodecyl magnesium bromide and 3,3'-dibromo-2,2'-bithiophene)
as a colorless solid (92 %) after column chromatography.
3,3'-(2-ethyl-hexyl)-2,2'-bithiophene 9. Compound 9 was prepared as a
colorless liquid following the same procedures employed for compound 8,
but using 2-ethylhexyl magnesium bromide (90 %). 1H NMR (CD2Cl2, 400 MHz,
ppm): δ 7.30 (d, 2H), 6.94 (d, 2H), 2.43 (d, 4H), 1.52 (m, 2H), 1.21 (m,
16H), 0.83 (t, 6H), 0.75 (t, 6H). 13C NMR (CD2Cl2, 100 MHz, ppm): δ
142.15, 129.93, 129.58, 125.58, 40.88, 33.56, 33.23, 29.32, 26.35, 23.55,
14.44, 11.08. GC-MS: m/z: 390 (C24H38S2+), 193 (100%).
